# Beacon Services Component

Service lifecycle management and metadata coordination for beacon nodes.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Service interface pattern with Start/Stop/Ready/OnReady lifecycle hooks
- Metadata service manages beacon node specs, genesis info, and wallclock synchronization
- Client detection via node version string parsing

## Important Constraints
- Services must handle beacon node health transitions gracefully with retry logic
- Metadata refresh must use exponential backoff during initialization
- Thread-safe wallclock access required (use mutex protection)